sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Den as Dentist
    actor Rec as Receptionist
    participant PSvc as PostCareService
    participant BgJob as AppointmentReminderBackgroundService
    participant RemSvc as AppointmentReminderService
    participant DB as SQL Server

    Den->>PSvc: CreateFollowUpAsync(dentistUserId, SourceAppointmentId, RecommendedDate, Reason)
    PSvc->>DB: INSERT FollowUpSchedules (Status='Proposed', RecommendedDate, Reason)
    Note right of DB: FollowUpSchedule is a clinical recommendation,<br/>NOT an auto-confirmed Appointment!

    Rec->>PSvc: Coordinate & confirm follow-up slot with Patient
    PSvc->>DB: INSERT new Appointments & UPDATE FollowUpSchedules SET ResultingAppointmentId=@newId, Status='Scheduled'

    loop Periodic Background Tick
      BgJob->>RemSvc: ProcessDueRemindersAsync(utcNow)
      RemSvc->>DB: SELECT Notifications WHERE DeliveryStatus='Pending' AND ScheduledFor <= @utcNow
      RemSvc->>DB: Deliver InApp / Email notification & UPDATE Notifications SET DeliveryStatus='Sent', SentAt=@utcNow
    end